  "description": "C# Code 93 Barcode Reader Guide: This package includes C# sample source code to scan, read Code 93 barcodes from image, PDF, Tiff, Office Word, Excel, PowerPoint files using XImage.Barcode Reader library\n\nInput :\n* Raster images: bitmap (.bmp), gif, png, jpeg/jpg\n* Document formats: PDF, multi-page TIFF, Word (.docx), Excel (.xlsx), PowerPoint (.pptx)\n* Stream objects or binary data\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\nOnline Guides :\n* C# Developer Guide : https://www.rasteredge.com/how-to/csharp-imaging/barcode-reading-start/\n* Support : support@rasteredge.com",
